# AETHER — Page-by-Page Feature Specifications

This is the detailed spec for every page: layout zones, every button/control, and the empty/loading/error states each page needs. Read alongside `02_Complete_Sitemap_and_Routes.md` for the URL map.

---

## 1. Landing Page (`/`)

**Layout, top to bottom:**

1. **Nav bar**: Logo · Product · Pricing · Marketplace · Docs · (spacer) · Log in (text link) · Sign up free (filled button)
2. **Hero**: Headline ("Build a trading agent by dragging boxes, not writing infra") · subheadline · primary CTA "Start building — free" · secondary CTA "Watch 90-sec demo" (opens video modal) · hero visual: animated preview of nodes connecting on a canvas
3. **Stats bar** *(optional, use placeholders until real data exists)*: bots built, backtests run, community presets
4. **"How it works" — 4 steps**: Pick your layers → Connect them on the canvas → Backtest instantly → Save, share, or go live. Each step has an icon + one-line description.
5. **Feature grid** (6 cards): Drag-and-drop builder · 13 customizable layers · Instant backtesting · Self-learning memory (bots improve from their own trade history) · Fork & share presets · Pay only for what you unlock
6. **Layer showcase carousel**: horizontally scrollable cards, one per layer (Data Collection, Feature Engineering, Intelligence Agents, Risk Management, Execution, Self-Learning, Memory...), each with a short description and a "lock" or "free" badge
7. **Live mini-demo embed** *(stretch goal)*: a simplified, read-only interactive canvas visitors can click around in without logging in
8. **Pricing teaser**: 3 plan cards (Free / Pro / Pay-as-you-go) with a "See full pricing" link
9. **Marketplace teaser**: 3–4 trending community preset cards with author name, thumbnail graph, and headline backtest stat
10. **Testimonials** *(placeholder until real users exist)*
11. **FAQ accordion**: "Is this financial advice?" (No — answer clearly) · "Does this trade with real money?" · "What data sources are supported?" · "How does pricing work?"
12. **Final CTA banner**: "Build your first bot in 5 minutes" + Sign up button
13. **Footer**: Product/Company/Legal link columns, social icons, risk disclosure link (small print), copyright

**States**: none beyond standard responsive breakpoints — this page has no auth-dependent content.

