## 2. Pricing Page (`/pricing`)

- **Billing toggle**: Monthly ⇄ Annual (shows "save X%" badge on annual)
- **Plan cards** (recommend 3–4):
  - **Free** — Buttons: "Get started"
  - **Starter** — Buttons: "Start free trial" / "Subscribe"
  - **Pro** — Buttons: "Subscribe" (highlighted as "Most popular")
  - **Pay-as-you-go** — separate card explaining credit-based unlocks, no subscription commitment
- **Feature comparison table**: rows = individual layers/features (Data Sources: X of Y, Risk Management: basic/advanced, Backtests/month, Live paper trading, Marketplace publishing, Real-fund execution), columns = plans, cells = ✅ / ❌ / a number
- **FAQ section**: billing cycle questions, refund policy link, "can I unlock a single layer without subscribing?" (yes → explains pay-as-you-go)
- Every "Subscribe"/"Get started" button → Razorpay Checkout (subscriptions) or, if logged out, → `/signup?plan=starter` first

