## 7. Dashboard (`/app`)

- **Header**: "Welcome back, {name}" + 4 stat cards: Active bots · Backtests run this month · Best-performing bot (name + return %) · Credits remaining
- **"Continue building"** row: cards for the 3 most recently edited bots, each with "Open in builder" button
- **Quick actions row**: "+ New bot" · "Browse marketplace" · "Run a backtest"
- **Activity feed**: reverse-chronological list — "Backtest completed on {bot}" · "{preset} was forked by another user" · "Self-learning added a new rule to {bot}" · each item links to the relevant detail page
- **Upgrade banner** (conditional): shown only when a free-plan user is near a usage limit, e.g. "You've used 8/10 backtests this month — Upgrade for unlimited"
- **Empty state** (brand-new user who skipped onboarding's guided bot): illustration + "You haven't built a bot yet" + "+ New bot" CTA

