## 8. Builder / Canvas (`/app/builder/:botId`) — the centerpiece page

Full mechanics are in `04_Builder_Canvas_Deep_Dive.md`. Layout summary:

- **Top toolbar**: editable bot name · Save · Save as Preset (dropdown) · Version history · Undo/Redo · Validate · Share · **Run Backtest** (primary button) · Go Live (secondary, gated) · zoom controls · fit-to-screen
- **Left panel — Component Library**: search box, category tabs matching the 13 layers, draggable component cards, lock icons on gated components, hover tooltip with description + unlock cost
- **Center — Canvas**: infinite pan/zoom surface, colored translucent "layer bands" behind grouped nodes (visual callback to the original architecture diagram), nodes with input/output ports, connectors between them, minimap (bottom-right), grid background
- **Right panel — Node Inspector** (appears when a node is selected): node name, description, all config fields for that specific component, an on/off toggle, a "Remove from canvas" button
- **Bottom panel — Console** (collapsible): validation warnings/errors, real-time log during a run
- **States**: empty canvas (first-time), node error state (red outline + tooltip on hover), locked-node click → upsell modal, unsaved-changes indicator + browser "leave without saving?" guard

