## 9. My Bots (`/app/bots`)

- View toggle: Grid / List
- Each bot card: name, mini graph thumbnail, status badge (Draft / Backtested / Live / Paused / Error), last modified date, headline metric (best backtest return)
- Filter bar: status, tags, date range
- Sort dropdown: Last modified, Name, Performance
- Bulk selection checkboxes → bulk actions bar: Archive, Duplicate, Delete
- "+ New bot" button (top right)
- **Empty state**: "No bots yet" + CTA

## 10. Bot Overview (`/app/bots/:botId`)

- Header: bot name, status badge, "Open in builder" button
- Tabs: Overview | Backtests | Live | Settings
- Overview tab: graph thumbnail (click to open builder), summary stats, list of recent backtest runs with quick links, "Publish to marketplace" button

## 11. Backtest Page (`/app/bots/:botId/backtest`)

- **Config panel**: date range picker, asset/pair selector, starting capital input, fee/slippage assumption inputs, random seed field, test-type tabs (Historical / Walk-forward / Monte Carlo / Paper trading / A/B compare)
- **Run button** → progress bar + live log stream
- **Results dashboard** (appears after run):
  - Equity curve chart (line chart)
  - Metric cards: Total return, Win rate, Max drawdown, Sharpe ratio, Number of trades, Avg R-multiple
  - Trade log table: entry/exit time, size, P&L, which layer/node triggered the decision, confidence score — sortable, filterable
  - Per-layer contribution panel: "Risk Gate blocked 12 trades, estimated avoided loss ₹X" style breakdown
  - Self-learning insights panel: new rules derived this run, notable post-mortems on losing trades
  - Buttons: Export report (PDF/CSV), Save as new preset, Compare to previous run, Promote to live
- **Empty/first-run state**: friendly explanation of what a backtest does before the first run

## 12. Live Run Monitor / "Aether View" (`/app/bots/:botId/live`)

- Status control: Running / Paused / Stopped toggle + big, unmistakable **"Stop Bot"** kill-switch button
- Real-time equity/P&L chart (streaming)
- Open positions table
- Live activity log (streaming console of agent decisions)
- Risk limits display: max daily loss, position size caps (edit requires re-confirmation)
- Alert settings shortcut (links to `/app/account/notifications`)
- Clear, persistent banner: "Paper trading — no real funds are being used" (unless/until the account has an explicitly verified real-fund tier active, in which case the banner instead clearly states real capital is at risk)

## 13. Bot Settings (`/app/bots/:botId/settings`)

- Rename bot, description field
- Visibility: Private / Unlisted (link-only) / Public
- Collaborators (optional, future: invite others to view/edit)
- Danger zone: Archive bot, Delete bot (confirmation modal)

