## 15. Marketplace (`/app/marketplace` and public `/marketplace`)

- Search bar + filters: by layer composition, price (Free/Paid), popularity, most forked, newest, performance tier
- Preset cards: title, author avatar+name, graph thumbnail, headline backtest stat (with a small "past performance ≠ future results" disclaimer), price, fork count, star rating
- Sort dropdown
- **Detail page** (`/app/marketplace/:presetId`): full description, author's notes, layer breakdown diagram, sample backtest report, reviews/comments section, **"Clone to my bots"** button (may deduct credits or trigger a Razorpay purchase), "Report" link (moderation)
- Public (logged-out) version of detail page: everything except "Clone" is visible; that button becomes "Sign up to clone"

## 16. Publish Flow (`/app/marketplace/publish/:botId`)

- Step 1: Choose visibility (Public free / Public paid / Unlisted)
- Step 2: If paid — set price, agree to marketplace revenue-share terms
- Step 3: Write description, tag categories
- Step 4: Attach a backtest report as proof (required — no publishing without at least one saved backtest run)
- Step 5: Review & publish

