## 21. Account Settings

- **Profile** (`/app/account/profile`): avatar upload, display name, bio, "Make my profile public" toggle (needed if they publish to marketplace as a creator)
- **Security** (`/app/account/security`): change password, enable/disable 2FA, list of active sessions with "Log out" per session, "Log out everywhere" button
