## 23. Legal Pages

- **Risk Disclosure** is the one to get right: must explicitly state that (a) the platform is a tool, not investment advice, (b) default mode is paper trading with no real funds, (c) any real-fund execution tier carries genuine risk of loss and requires explicit, separate opt-in and acknowledgment, (d) past backtest performance does not guarantee future results — this line should also appear inline wherever backtest results are displayed, not just buried in the legal page.